    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nɛy tin cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ bööth nath ku kɛ cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cu duɔth nath gaakni yuɔr kɛ ɣöö ba dhɔr kɛl kä dho̱r da̱ŋ wäl ka̱n bɛ ben cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wec in rɛl ɔ, bi duɔth dho̱ri da̱ŋ bäŋuan cu duɔth wi̱i̱nikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu naath nɛy tin ca nhɔk ɛn ɣöö bi wä cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm la̱r tɛ̈th lɔaac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ bööth wi̱i̱ni tëë cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, duundɛ ɣöö rɛy wi̱i̱ni Juda cu ramɔ cieŋ kɛ kuakɛ wi̱i̱diɛn. Ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ bööth palä, kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay, kɛ la̱a̱t luaak Kuɔth, kɛ kuay la̱a̱tni Thɔ-lo-mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cu ji̱ Juda kɛnɛ ji̱ Ben-ya-min cieŋ thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ä-ta-yaa gat U-dhi-yaa gat Dhɛ-kar-yaa gat Ä-mɛ̈r-yaa gat Cɛ-pɛ̈t-yaa gat Maa-lä-lɛl kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Pɛ-rɛdh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Mä-the-yaa gat Ba-ruk gat Kɔl-ɣo-dhɛ gat Ɣä-dha-yaa gat Ä-da-yaa gat Yo-ya-rib gat Dhɛ-kar-yaa kuɛ̈ɛ̈ Cilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu pek kuayni Pɛ-rɛdh tin cieŋ kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm a nɛy ti kur ŋuan wi̱cdɛ jiɛn bäkɛl wi̱cdɛ bädäk ti la wutni köör.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thɛ̈lu gat Mɛ-cu-lam gat Yo-wed gat Pɛ-da-yaa gat Ko-la-yaa gat Mä-the-yaa gat I-thi-el gat Yɛ-cɛ̈-yaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ ji̱ maarädɛ ni Gɛ̈-bay kɛnɛ Thɛ̈-lay, nɛy ti kur bäŋuan wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bädäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-el gat Dhik-ri a bo̱o̱thdiɛn, cua guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ Juda gat Ɣɛ̈-thɛ-nua ɛn wi̱c.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛ-dɛ̈-yaa gat Yo-ya-rib kɛnɛ Ya-kin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ Thɛ-ra-yaa gat Ɣil-ki-yaa gat Mɛ-cu-lam gat Dha-dok gat Mɛ-ra-yoth gat Ä-ɣi-tub ti̱i̱t luaak Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy tëë lua̱kɛ kɛ, kɛ la̱t luaak Kuɔth a nɛy ti kur bädäk wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ rɛw. Cua Ä-da-yaa gat Yɛ-ro-ɣaam gat Pɛ-lɛ̈l-yaa gat Ɛ̈m-dhi gat Dhɛ-kar-yaa gat Pɛ̈c-ɣur gat Mɛ̈l-ki-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaatman tëë la bööth dho̱ri gua̱ni a wutni ti kur rɛw wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ rɛw. Kä cua Ä-mac-thay gat Ä-dhar-el gat A̱-dhay gat Mɛ-ci-lɛ-moth gat I-mer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ gaatmani tin wutni köör ti buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m ti kuɔ̱r kɛl wi̱cdɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bädäk. Cu bo̱o̱thdiɛn a Dhab-di-yel gat Ɣɛ̈-gɛ-do-lim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cɛ-mɛ̈-yaa gat Ɣɛ̈-cub gat Ɛ̈dh-ri-kɔm gat Ɣä-cɛ̈b-yaa gat Buni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Cɛ̈-bɛ-thay kɛnɛ Yo-dha-bad bööth ji̱ Lii-bay tin ca ka̱m la̱t raar luaak Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Mɛ̈-tɛ̈n-yaa gat Mika gat Dhab-di gat A-thap naath bo̱th kɛ pal tɛthä lɔaac, cua guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ Bak-bu-ki-yaa kɛnɛ Ɛ̈bda gat Cä-muwä gat Ga-lal gat Yɛ-du-thun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn ji̱ Lii-bay diaal tin te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ nɛy ti kur rɛw wi̱cdɛ jiɛn bädäk wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ̈-kub kɛnɛ Tɛ̈l-mon kɛ gaatmani tin gaŋkɛ thok kal, cu kɛn a nɛy ti kuɔ̱r wi̱cdɛ jiɛn bärɔw wi̱cdɛ rɛw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu duɔth ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ ji̱ Lii-bay cieŋ rɛy wi̱i̱ni Juda, te ram ɔ rɛy kuaknikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu la̱a̱t luaak Kuɔth cieŋ kä O-pɛl. Cua kɛ guɛc lät ɛ Dhi-ɣa kɛnɛ Gic-pa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth ji̱ Lii-bay tin te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm a Udhi gat Bani gat Ɣä-cɛ̈b-yaa gat Mɛ̈-tɛ̈n-yaa gat Mika gaat A-thap, tëë la keet din, cukɛ la̱t luaak Kuɔth guɛc thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn te ruacdiɛn kɛ kuäär, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ rialikä kɛ ŋaani ba diit bo̱th tɔ̱ rɛy luaak Kuɔth kɛ cäŋ ɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
