        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Ben-ya-min cieŋ kä Gabä a wä kä Mik-mac kɛnɛ A-yaa kɛ Beth-ɛl kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
